<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK SELLS 20 MLN KROONS OF CDS.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK SELLS 20 MLN KROONS OF CDS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank said it sold 20 million kroons worth of certificates of deposits (CD) at its auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The central bank offered 300 certificates in the sum of 30 million kroons, but the demand was for 20 million kroons, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The average yield was 4.75 percent.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
